{"id":"steam-5401220","steam":5401220,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Space Racing Warriors","summary":"Space Racing Warriors is a fast-paced multiplayer racing game. Pilot hover ships on spectacular neon circuits, blast rivals with missiles and EMPs, master the boost and climb the global leaderboards.","about":"SPACE RACING WARRIORS — Full-throttle racing. Weapons on the track.\n\nPilot high-speed jet-powered racing ships across neon tracks suspended over impossible worlds: synthwave harbors, sunset deserts, hidden jungle temples, and orbital rings.\n\nNo gravity. No brakes. No mercy.\n\nRACING WITH FIREPOWER\n\nBeing fast isn't enough: lock-on missiles, EMP blasts, energy walls, and shields turn every race into a battle.\n\nTake out the racer ahead of you — or end up smashed into the wall.\n\nEvery race is a fight.\n\nSINGLE-PLAYER MODES\n\n• \nCampaign: Win each race to unlock the next track. 9 levels with increasingly aggressive AI.\n• \nTime Trial: 3 laps, lap records, and ghost racing so you can compete against your own best time.\n• \nEndless: Race against AI opponents that become tougher with every lap.\n\nONLINE MULTIPLAYER\n\nRace with up to 4 pilots in real time on the same track, powered by an authoritative server system and global leaderboards.\n\nCompete in daily, weekly, and seasonal rankings.\n\n9 TRACKS, 6 SHIPS\n\n• \nNEON HARBOR — the classic synthwave circuit.\n• \nCRYSTAL RUN — high-speed racing across frozen landscapes.\n• \nEMERALD TEMPLE — deep in the heart of the jungle.\n• \nORBIT RING — racing in outer space.\n• \nPlus 5 more tracks, each featuring shortcuts, tunnels, tubes, and massive jumps.\n• \n6 playable ships, all upgradeable through the progression system.\n\nPROGRESSION & GARAGE\n\nEarn coins by racing, upgrade your ships in the garage, unlock elite tracks, and show off your best records on the leaderboards.\n\nGLOBAL RANKINGS\n\nTrack- and mode-based leaderboards with seasonal competition.\n\nRace against your own ghost — and against the world.\n\nKEY FEATURES\n\n• \nArcade racing with weapons: missiles, EMP blasts, energy walls, shields, and nitro.\n• \nOnline multiplayer for up to 4 pilots with cross-play between Windows and web.\n• \n9 themed tracks and 6 upgradeable racing ships.\n• \nCampaign + Time Trial + Endless + Multiplayer.\n• \nDaily, weekly, and seasonal global leaderboards.\n• \nOptimized performance: 60 FPS on modest hardware.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5401220/1bc82bb1046b587260735de06f4b9c439626ea0b/library_capsule.jpg?t=1794572967","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5401220/639aa085a583ab4a8ee605c56ce07c9c53271e35/header.jpg?t=1794572967","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5401220/57bef95f6d8e9135e5c878c532e72cf3571f6854/library_hero.jpg?t=1794572967","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5401220/639aa085a583ab4a8ee605c56ce07c9c53271e35/header.jpg?t=1794572967","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5401220/5880989004c3abcff5da9c30019357fd78fec10e/page_bg_v6.jpg?t=1794572967","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5401220/ff78dc7ccb27bbb5b8a48c8c1592313a78ae3636/ss_ff78dc7ccb27bbb5b8a48c8c1592313a78ae3636.600x338.jpg?t=1794572967","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5401220/ff78dc7ccb27bbb5b8a48c8c1592313a78ae3636/ss_ff78dc7ccb27bbb5b8a48c8c1592313a78ae3636.jpg?t=1794572967"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5401220/62474ae9e2031490d210344a6603581da51a11a8/ss_62474ae9e2031490d210344a6603581da51a11a8.600x338.jpg?t=1794572967","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5401220/62474ae9e2031490d210344a6603581da51a11a8/ss_62474ae9e2031490d210344a6603581da51a11a8.jpg?t=1794572967"},{"thumb":"h